                  "content": "border-radius：\n  InputBox 14 | Dropdown 10 | Card 14\n  Button 8 | Chip 6 | Badge 4\n\n号序：\n  Logo 14 | Body 13 | Think 12-13\n  Context 11 | Code 11 | Badge 10\n  ModelSel 9 | Arrow 8\n\n固定尺寸：\n  Header h52 | CtxBar h32\n  SendBtn 28x28 | HeaderBtn 32x32\n  ModeDot 6x6 | Scrollbar w3\n  DragHandle h6 | ResizeHandle w4",
